<#f0c83c>GOLD EXPERIENCE</>
Stand On / Off (air too)		^X
  With Gold Experience out, his normals and specials use
  the Stand. With it off he fights on his own.
Stand Strike		_D_DF_F^X
Stand Cancel (during an attack)		^X
  Switches the Stand on or off. Ground only, on hit or whiff.
  Half a bar, plus half a bar per earlier cancel that combo.

<#f0c83c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash		_F_F (air)

<#f0c83c>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#f0c83c>SPECIALS</>
MUDAx3		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
EX MUDAx3 (half a bar)		_D_DF_F^C
  Invincible start.
This is our true path! (air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Life, spring forth!		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C
Now, it lives		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Be grown!		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C
  In Requiem: Return to Zero.

<#f0c83c>SUPERS</>
MUDA MUDA MUDA MUDA! (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Life... is born! (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Requiem (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Gold Experience Requiem for the rest of the round.
You will never reach the truth (3 bars, Requiem)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work for every super.
